OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight, the
OL,6,Fscattered showers in the west will
OL,7,Ffade out, but it will become
OL,8,Fincreasingly cloudy. Winds will ease
OL,9,Fto a light breeze and it will feel
OL,10,Fchilly in single-digit temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FTomorrow will see a bright
OL,13,Fmorning, but becoming increasingly
OL,14,Fmild and grey. Patchy rain arrives
OL,15,Fwith a brisk breeze in the west but
OL,16,Fmost eastern areas will remain dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
