OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOvercast and murky on Monday with
OL,7,Fspots of rain through the day.
OL,8,FBecoming much brighter on Tuesday
OL,9,Fafter a morning of rain and strong
OL,10,Fwinds. Bright and breezy on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
